{"results":[{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/supreme-real-estate-developer/supreme-imperial-138161","title":"Supreme Imperial, Borivali West, Mumbai | 2 & 3 BHK Premium Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"[![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)](/)\n\n[![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\n![Project Image of Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 228209](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/Project%20Image/1-1742638260.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Project Image of Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 228208](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/Project%20Image/2-1742638260.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Amenities of Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 228210](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/Amenities/3-1742638266.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Amenities of Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 228211](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/Amenities/4-1742638266.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Location of Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 228212](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/Location/Hou-1742638271.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n## Project Overview of Supreme Imperial Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n100 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n1.11 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n5 Towers / 9 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nSupreme Imperial is a thoughtfully designed residential project that brings together comfort, convenience, and modern living. Featuring spacious 1, 2, and 3 BHK apartments, this development caters to families seeking a harmonious balance between urban connectivity and peaceful surroundings. Every home is crafted with care, ensuring ample space, natural light, and ventilation for a refreshing living experience.  \n  \nLocated in a well-connected neighborhood, Supreme Imperial offers seamless access to essential amenities, schools, hospitals, and entertainment hubs. Whether you're commuting to work or enjoying leisure time with your loved ones, everything you need is just a short distance away. The project’s layout enhances privacy while fostering a sense of community, making it an ideal choice for modern families.  \n  \nBeyond the walls of your apartment, Supreme Imperial ensures a fulfilling lifestyle with thoughtfully planned open spaces, landscaped gardens, and recreational facilities. Here, you can unwind, socialize, and create cherished memories with your family. Embrace a life of ease and tranquility, where contemporary comforts meet the warmth of a perfect home.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Supreme Imperial Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 834758](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/BHK_Configuration/1-BHK-428-CA-1742638089.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n428 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.3 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 834759](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/BHK_Configuration/2-BHK-525-CA-1742638096.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n525 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.6 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 834760](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/BHK_Configuration/2-BHK-644-CA-1742638107.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n644 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.98 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Supreme Imperial in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 834761](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/138161/BHK_Configuration/3-BHK-837-CA-1742638124.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n837 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.58 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Supreme Imperial Borivali West, Mumbai\