ivali.west/sale/flats/property-view/open-view)\n\n### Explore Nearby Localities\n\n* [Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Borivali West](/mumbai-borivali.west/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Dahisar East](/mumbai-dahisar.east/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Dahisar West](/mumbai-dahisar.west/sale/flats)\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/supreme-imperial","title":"Supreme Imperial In Borivali West | Buy 1 & 2 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21)\n\n>\n\nShreeji Realtors\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-realtors-supreme-imperial-bedroom-1675345763.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-realtors-supreme-imperial-bedroom-1675345763.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-realtors-supreme-imperial-bedroom-1675345763.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-realtors-supreme-imperial-bedroom-1675345763.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shreeji-realtors-supreme-imperial-bedroom-1675345763.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/131022010353-newproject-2022-10-13t125906421.jpg)\n\n# Supreme Imperial\n\nPLOT no 541 & 545, Shimpoli, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹95.28 L - 1.43 Cr\n\n₹95.28 L - 1.43 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nIntroducing Supreme Imperial, a stunning development with thoughtfully designed living space that is the hallmark of well-priced, well put out flats. With its stunning residences in Borivali, Supreme Imperial offers a lifestyle fit for a king. Due to Supreme Imperial, you will no longer be aware that you are residing in the centre of the city, making your home the ideal retreat following a long day at work. These residential apartments in Borivali provide opulent residences that miraculously escape the city center's noise. Additionally, residing in apartments in a decent location has a variety of advantages. Supreme Imperial is strategically positioned in Borivali to enable unparalleled connection to all significant monuments and locations of daily usage, including various well-known hospitals, educational institutions, super-marts, parks, entertainment spots, recreational centers and so on.\n\nConfiguration\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Apr 2025\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹22,261/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n428 - 644 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Discover a luxurious lifestyle at a futuristic location.\n* The satisfaction of unnoticed care\n* Architecture focused on design\n\n* Family time should be spent together.\n* Intelligently constructed\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nGoogle reviews for Supreme Imperial highlight it as a well-maintained and premium residential project in the Shimpoli area of Borivali West. Residents and visitors frequently praise the building's modern architecture, cleanliness, and the sense of tranquility it offers despite being in a busy suburb. The project is often noted for its high-quality construction and professional management.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nPrime Connectivity\n\nLocated within walking distance of the Shimpoli Metro Station and offers easy access to the New Link Road and SV Road.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nFeatures a well-equipped gymnasium, multipurpose hall, children's play area, and a rooftop garden.\n\nSafety and Security\n\nEquipped with 24/7 CCTV surveillance, professional security personnel, and advanced fire safety systems.\n\nInfrastructure Quality\n\nHigh-quality internal finishes including vitrified flooring, branded sanitary ware, and concealed copper wiring.\n\nPeaceful Environment\n\nDespite its central location, the project is noted for providing a quiet living environment away from the main road noise.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nLimited Open Space\n\nLike many standalone or mid-sized redevelopments in Borivali, the project has restricted open ground area for outdoor activities.\n\nParking Constraints\n\nSome reviews mention that while podium parking is available, the maneuverability for larger vehicles can be tight.\n\nHigher Price Point\n\nThe premium nature of the project reflects in its pricing, which is higher compared to older societies in the immediate vicinity.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nSupreme Imperial is an excellent choice for nuclear families and professionals seeking a modern, secure, and well-connected home in Borivali West.\n\nThe project stands out for its superior construction quality and proximity to the metro, making it a strong long-term investment.\n\nIt is less suitable for those prioritizing large sprawling landscapes or extensive sports fields within the complex.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multipurpose-Hall-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multipurpose-Hall-secondary.svg)\n\nParty Lawn\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multipurpose-Hall-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multipurpose-Hall-primary.svg)\n\nParty Lawn\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n1 BHK\n\n2 BHK\n\n* ## 428 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n1 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹95.28 L\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/shreeji-realtors-supreme-imperial-1-bhk-bedroom-1675345988.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![bank-primary](/assets/icons/bank-primary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![hospital-secondary](/assets/icons/hospital-secondary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![school-secondary](/assets/icons/school-secondary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nKarnataka Bank - Vazira Naka Branch\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nBank Of Maharashtra - Mumbai-Borivli West Branch\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nHdfc Bank\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nBank Of Baroda Atm\n\n0.5 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nRameshwar Co-Operative Bank Limited\n\n0.6 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nAxis Bank - Sai Baba Nagar, Borivali (West)\n\n0.7 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹99,562per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹1,19,47,475\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-dow