t. 1 BHK – 1.5 BHK – 2 BHK – 3 BHK Configuration. Jodi flats also possible. All flats are with Vaastu compliance entrance door. Ground + 10 Storied Tower. Podium Parking with Ramp. Stack & Open space also available for Parking. Gym – Multipurpose Hall – Garden – Senior Citizen seating & more. wall with brick work & plaster. Branded flooring & other tiling work in kitchen & bathrooms – wiring – lift – fire system – sliding – intercom. Great connectivity from Railway station, SV Road, Link Road & metro station. All daily needs you will get just few steps from Society gate.\n\nPrice   \n  **95.28 Lac - 1.96 Cr**\n\nArea   \n **575 Sq.Ft. - 947 Sq.Ft.**\n\nPossession   \n **November-2023**\n\nConfiguration   \n  **1, 2, 2 BHK**\n\nCity   \n **Mumbai Bandra - Dahisar**\n\nLocation   \n **Borivali (West)**\n\nCommencement Certificate   \n **Yes**\n\nOccupancy Certificate   \n **No**\n\nApproved by   \n **Municipal Authority, RERA**\n\n# Specification\n\nA Wing 6 Flats Per Floor & 3 Lifts\n\nFlat No 1         2 BHK 650   \n Flat No 2         2 BHK 644   \n Flat No 3         1 BHK 418  \n Flat No 4         2 BHK 544  \n Flat No 5         1.5 BHK 494   \n Flat No 6         2 BHK 572 \n\n \n\nB Wing 4 Flat with 2 Lift (Jodi Available)\n\nFlat No 1         1 BHK 459   \n Flat No 2         1 BHK 459   \n Flat No 3         1 BHK 428   \n Flat No 4         1 BHK 428 \n\n \n\nC Wing 6 Flats Per Floor & 3 Lifts\n\nFlat No 1         2 BHK 564   \n Flat No 2         2 BHK 617   \n Flat No 3         2 BHK 630   \n Flat No 4         1 BHK 427   \n Flat No 5         2 BHK 640   \n Flat No 6         2 BHK 570 \n\n \n\nD Wing 6 Flats Per Floor & 3 Lifts\n\nFlat No 1         2 BHK 560   \n Flat No 2         2 BHK 640  \n Flat No 3         1 BHK 397   \n Flat No 4         2 BHK 630   \n Flat No 5         2 BHK 617   \n Flat No 6         2 BHK 589 \n\n \n\nE Wing 3 Flats Per Floor & 2 Lifts\n\nFlat No 1         3 BHK 837 Not Avail   \n Flat No 2         2 BHK 513  \n Flat No 3         2 BHK 